<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Monitor de Remédios</title>
    <script src="https://telegram.org/js/telegram-web-app.js"></script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; background: #f0f2f5; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }
        .card { background: white; border-radius: 15px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .status { font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0; }
        .online { color: #28a745; }
        button { background: #0088cc; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h2>💊 Monitor de Saúde</h2>
        <hr>
        <div class="status online">● Sistema Ativo</div>
        <p>Acompanhamento em tempo real do dispositivo ESP32.</p>
        <button onclick="Telegram.WebApp.close()">Voltar ao Chat</button>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
